        "description": "<p>Koppel-je-boekhouding.nl is a plugin that allows you to connect your WooCommerce webshop to your Koppel Je Boekhouding account.<br />\nYou can use Koppel-je-boekhouding.nl to automatically synchronize your WooCommerce orders with your accounting software.</p>\n",
